A||||30||William||My black / tan interior is finally complete.... check out the details and the pics!!||||6||
Z||000000||William||03-09-2001||08:50 PM||||Well it's finally all done. Over the last few months, I have spent every free minute and ever last dime on this interior. Every since I saw a black / tan Ferarri 308 interior, I knew it was what I wanted. The project has turned out exactly the way I had invisioned and I'm quite proud. I hope you guy's like it. Now for the details....<P>These parts were robbed off other Fieros. A mint dash, 120 backlit speedo cluster, aux rally gauges, aux gauge radio surround, 84 short shifter, and carpet /emblem style map pocket.<P>I used SEM vinyl paint and painted the dash, radio pod, shifter surround, overhead cover, aux cover, and cluster covers satin black. Bye Bye poop brown!!!!  All the trim plates were refinshed to mirror black. The aux gauges were wired up,(thx darklord / Batboy!), and the cluster was swapped. The firewall panel was then recovered in black felt. The map pocket was dyed using rite dye in boiling hot water. Next, all the tan trim was removed and cleaned. Following is the list of Items that were bought.<P>MrMikes tan leather seats,( with speaker holes and emblems), Tan ebrake boot, tan leather door uppers, and leather stitched arm rests. I added a black leather shift knob from the fiero store. From ACC I received the main carpet in Camel Tan, floor mats with the Fiero logo, and some extra as I had to custom cut the carpet for the doors. The interior then got a Grant formula wheel in black. For the tunes, I went with the Pioneer 1.5 DIN unit, 4x10 kenwoods up front, and 4 3 1/2inch Pioneer coaxials with bass blockers in the seats. Here are some pics...............<P><BR> <IMG SRC="http://members.aol.com/williamz1/1.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://members.aol.com/williamz1/2.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://members.aol.com/williamz1/3.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://members.aol.com/williamz1/4.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://members.aol.com/williamz1/5.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://members.aol.com/williamz1/6.jpg"> <P>  <IMG SRC="http://members.aol.com/williamz1/7.jpg"> <P>||||reg||6
Z||000001||DXR_DAD||03-09-2001||09:03 PM||||William, Yes you have done a great job!!!!<P>I like it  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P><BR>DXR_DAD||||reg||10
